eral  it seems like grenades that diffuse  damage into a bunch of little  projectiles are tougher to ensure a kill  but if you follow up with some stabber E  then you're in business  the gunslinger can always melee stabbed  and when upgraded can throw a knife into  the black heart or the red eye or the  white stomach or whatever of your  enemies like with the Golden Gun aim is  paramount if you can't hit the guy it's  not worth it but when you do hit the guy  it's great you'll either kill him and  then you're all yeah eat it or you  barely do any damage and it's like you  threw your knife at a car or something  and it's hilarious take that but that's  going to scratch your paint job so  gunslinger is a very attack focused  subclass bladedancer is also a very  attacked focused subclass the difference  is range of engagement while you can sit  back and rein solar death down on  enemies as the gunslinger the Blade  Dancer gets up close and personal with  the arc blade super ability activate  this bad boy and Shazam it's dancing  time no not like dancing dancing stabby  dancing  if the reticle turns red pull the  trigger to dash forward with a deadly  strike with one upgrade the trigger will  also activate an area shockwave  this is great for clearing house in the  crucible and elsewhere mobs of enemies  will fall like wheat before the combine  like the Golden Gun it can take a few  strikes to take down bigger foes but  unlike the Golden Gun the arc blade is  pretty useless against big bosses  because getting close to them usually  means getting stomped by them close  combat always has its risks but with the  exception of those big boss enemies the  Blade Dancer can usually dance those  risks away before they become too risky  and by dance I mean stab  to further the melee madness the Blade  Dancer special melee attack is a blink  strike not the throwing knife the blink  strike teleports in a little bit letting  you stab from further away again you're  getting in close 